r.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/video_gen/initial_summary/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:35:07 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/feed_rss_created.xml">Griffindor 的笔记本</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/video_gen/initial_summary/</guid> </item> <item> <title>FlashGPU-Sim</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;FlashGPU-sim: Enabling GPU Modeling for Modern Architectures and AI Workloads&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;论文链接：[《FlashGPU-sim: Enabling GPU Modeling for Modern Architectures and AI...&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/gpu-sim/FlashGPU-Sim/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:35:07 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/feed_rss_created.xml">Griffindor 的笔记本</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/gpu-sim/FlashGPU-Sim/</guid> </item> <item> <title>H100 存储系统测试</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;H100 存储系统测试记录&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;BENCH 仓库：&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/Griffindorr/h100-bench&#34;&gt;H100 存储系统 benchmarks 集合&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;Background&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;测试集中于单张 NVIDIA H100( PCIe-80GB ) 服务器...&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/gpu-bench/report/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:35:07 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/feed_rss_created.xml">Griffindor 的笔记本</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/gpu-bench/report/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Raw material</title> <description>&lt;p&gt;On GH100 and GB100 chips the memory subsystem is divided into two primary partitions each servicing 4 GPCs. When a GPC on one partition reads from memory att...&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/gpu-bench/raw_material/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:35:07 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/feed_rss_created.xml">Griffindor 的笔记本</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/gpu-bench/raw_material/</guid> </item> <item> <title>GPU-BENCH</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;GPU-BENCH&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;对 NVIDIA H100( PCIe ) 测试的相关记录。&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/gpu-bench/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:35:07 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/feed_rss_created.xml">Griffindor 的笔记本</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/gpu-bench/</guid> </item> <item> <title>论文阅读</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;论文阅读&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;本目录为开展 research 期间相关笔记的集合。&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:35:07 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/feed_rss_created.xml">Griffindor 的笔记本</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/paper_reading/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Miscellaneous</title> <description>&lt;ol&gt; &lt;li&gt;generic proxy 和 aysnc proxy 是两种存储访问的标签，前者指 warp 中的 threads 通过 &lt;code&gt;load/store/atom&lt;/code&gt; 读写内存的方式，后者指 TMA/tensorcore 等其他硬件组件异步读写数据方式（这里的异步是相对于 threads 而言的）。两个 gener...&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ol&gt;</description> <link>https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/miscellaneous/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:35:07 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/feed_rss_created.xml">Griffindor 的笔记本</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://griffindorr.github.io/profile/research/miscellaneous/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Research 相关</title> <category>research</category> <description>&lt;h1&gt;Research 相关&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;!-- H100 板块暂时隐藏（恢复时把下面这行加回来，并同步改